    "description": "The denomination displays the value (200, 100, and 50) in Arabic numerals, below which appears the currency unit PESOS, the text REPÚBLICA DE COLOMBIA, and the year of issue. Additionally, the outline features raised waves alluding to the movement of water, reiterating the Issuer's commitment to the promotion and protection of our natural resources.",
