  "comments": "<p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59105f428bcd1.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59105f428bcd1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>An example of the 2013 version without the dots immediately next to \"PESOS\" (variant 2 dots)<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6107ae33682f1.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6107ae33682f1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>An example of the 2013 version with the 4 dots around \"PESOS\" (normal version)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/66ea04e11a737.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/66ea04e11a737.jpg\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The coin presents an error in the letters R and/or E of the word REPÚBLICA, with greater observation in the 2012 and 2013 versions.</p>",
